{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0170","paragraphs":[{"id":"pcd606be363b6-1","text":"群芳过後西湖好，狼籍残红。"},{"id":"pb64296444611-1","text":"飞絮蒙蒙。"},{"id":"p196652179720-1","text":"垂柳阑干尽日风。"},{"id":"p757e4a454cad-1","text":"笙歌散尽游人去，始觉春空。"},{"id":"p288844cfa592-1","text":"垂下帘栊。"},{"id":"p3fc6f8cfed00-1","text":"双燕归来细雨中。"}]}